OL,3,GNEWSARail works to cause weekend train
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers are being warned over
OL,7,Fdisruption this weekend, with direct
OL,8,Fservices between Sheffield and
OL,9,FManchester cancelled entirely.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail said trains would be
OL,12,Faffected on Saturday and Sunday while
OL,13,Fwork to replace the bridge deck at
OL,14,FBeauchief, in Sheffield, is carried
OL,15,Fout.
OL,17,FUnder the scheme, a new 73-tonne bridge
OL,18,Fdeck, which carries the railway over
OL,19,Fthe River Sheaf, will be lifted into
OL,20,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
