OL,3,GNEWSARail works to cause weekend train
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the weekend's disruption,
OL,7,FNetwork Rail's lead portfolio manager,
OL,8,FTom Grainger, said the company was
OL,9,F"very sorry for any inconvenience".
